  <div id="lessonContent">
    <h2>1. What is Freelancing?</h2>
    <p><b>Freelancing = You are your own boss. You find clients, you build websites, client pays you.</b> No office, no boss, no fixed salary. You work from home, from your phone, from anywhere.</p>
    <p>Example: A shop owner in Lahore needs a website. He pays you Rs. 20,000. You build it in 4 days from home. You keep Rs. 20,000. Do 2 websites a month = Rs. 40,000. Do 4 websites = Rs. 80,000. Your skill is now your income.</p>
    <div class="note"><b>Truth:</b> Your first client will NOT come from Fiverr. It will come from someone you KNOW - Friend, family, local shop, teacher. Start local, then go global. 90% of beginners fail because they wait for clients. Winners GO and ASK.</div>
    <h2>2. LIVE DEMO - Price Calculator - What to Charge?</h2>
    <p>Select website type and pages. See fair price + advance + delivery time:</p>
    <div class="demo-card">
      <div class="calc-wrap">
        <h3 style="text-align:center;margin:0">💰 Price Calculator - Try It</h3>
        <label style="font-size:13px;font-weight:bold">Website Type</label>
        <select class="demo-input" id="calcType" onchange="calcPrice()">
          <option value="landing">Landing Page - 1 Page</option>
          <option value="portfolio">Portfolio - 1 Page</option>
          <option value="business">Business Website - 5 Pages</option>
          <option value="shop">Online Shop - With Cart</option>
          <option value="school">School Website - With Forms</option>
        </select>
        <label style="font-size:13px;font-weight:bold">Your Experience</label>
        <select class="demo-input" id="calcExp" onchange="calcPrice()">
          <option value="new">New - 0 to 3 Projects</option>
          <option value="some">Some - 4 to 10 Projects</option>
          <option value="pro">Pro - 10+ Projects</option>
        </select>
        <label style="font-size:13px;font-weight:bold">Urgent? (Client needs in 2 days)</label>
        <select class="demo-input" id="calcUrgent" onchange="calcPrice()">
          <option value="no">No - Normal 5-7 Days</option>
          <option value="yes">Yes - Urgent in 2 Days (+30%)</option>
        </select>
        <div class="calc-result"><p style="margin:0;color:#cbd5e1">Charge This Price</p><b id="calcPrice">Rs. 8,000</b><p id="calcDetail" style="margin:8px 0 0;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:14px">Advance: Rs. 4,000 | Delivery: 3 Days</p><p style="font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;margin:6px 0 0">Take 50% advance BEFORE starting. Never start without advance.</p></div>
        <button class="btn" style="width:100%" onclick="calcPrice()">Calculate Again 💰</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2>3. Price List - Beginner to Pro</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Website</th><th>Beginner (0-3 Projects)</th><th>Some (4-10 Projects)</th><th>Pro (10+ Projects)</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Landing Page</td><td>Rs. 5,000 - 8,000</td><td>Rs. 10,000 - 15,000</td><td>Rs. 20,000 - 40,000</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Portfolio</td><td>Rs. 5,000 - 8,000</td><td>Rs. 10,000 - 12,000</td><td>Rs. 15,000 - 25,000</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Business Website (5 Pages)</td><td>Rs. 10,000 - 15,000</td><td>Rs. 20,000 - 30,000</td><td>Rs. 40,000 - 80,000</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Online Shop (Cart)</td><td>Rs. 15,000 - 20,000</td><td>Rs. 25,000 - 40,000</td><td>Rs. 50,000 - 100,000</td></tr>
      <tr><td>School Website</td><td>Rs. 12,000 - 18,000</td><td>Rs. 20,000 - 35,000</td><td>Rs. 40,000 - 70,000</td></tr>
    </table>
    <p><b>Rule:</b> Never work FREE "for exposure". Even first client - Charge Rs. 3,000-5,000. Free work = Client does not respect it. Paid work = Client takes you seriously.</p>
    <h2>4. Where to Find Clients - 5 Ways</h2>
    <p>1. <b>People You Know (Best for First Client):</b> Tell 20 people - "I build websites. If any shop needs one, I will make it for Rs. 8,000." - Friends, family, teachers, neighbours.<br>2. <b>Local Shops - Walk In:</b> Visit 10 shops in your area. Show your portfolio on phone. Say: "Your shop has no website. I can make one in 4 days for Rs. 10,000. Here is my work." - 1 out of 10 will say yes.<br>3. <b>WhatsApp Status + Facebook:</b> Post your portfolio link every week. "I Build Websites - Starting Rs. 8,000 - WhatsApp Me" - People share it.<br>4. <b>Fiverr / Upwork (Later):</b> After 3-5 local projects, make Fiverr gig. You now have reviews + portfolio to show. New account with no portfolio = No orders.<br>5. <b>Facebook Groups:</b> Join "Business in Lahore", "Shop Owners Pakistan" groups. Help people, answer questions, then offer service. Do NOT spam.</p>
    <h2>5. Proposal Message - Copy This (WhatsApp / Fiverr)</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="text">Hi [Shop Name], I saw your shop on Facebook - Very nice products! 👋</span><br><br>
<span class="text">I am [Your Name], a Web Developer from [Your City].</span><br>
<span class="text">I noticed your shop does not have a website yet.</span><br>
<span class="text">I can build you a beautiful website in 4 days -</span><br>
<span class="text">With your products, prices, WhatsApp order button, and Google Maps.</span><br><br>
<span class="text">Here is my work: [Your Portfolio Link]</span><br>
<span class="text">Price: Rs. 10,000 - 50% advance, 50% after delivery.</span><br><br>
<span class="text">Can I show you a free demo for your shop? No cost to see demo.</span><br>
<span class="text">Thanks! [Your Name] - WhatsApp: [Your Number]</span>
    </code></div>
    <p><b>Why this works:</b> Personal (shop name) + Problem (no website) + Solution (4 days) + Proof (portfolio link) + Price clear + Low risk (free demo). Do NOT send "Hi, I am developer, hire me" - That gets ignored.</p>
    <h2>6. Payment Rules - Protect Yourself</h2>
    <p><b>50% Advance - 50% After Delivery.</b> Never start without advance. Never deliver full website without final payment.</p>
    <p>1. Client agrees → Take 50% advance on JazzCash / Easypaisa / Bank<br>2. Build website → Show demo on YOUR link (your Netlify link, not theirs)<br>3. Client approves → Take remaining 50% → Then transfer / give code<br>4. Write everything on WhatsApp - Price, pages, delivery date, what is included. WhatsApp chat = Your proof.</p>
    <div class="note"><b>Red Flags - Say NO:</b> "Make it first, I will pay later" - NO. "I will pay after I get customers" - NO. "Make 3 designs, I will pick one" - NO, 1 design + 2 revisions. "My budget is Rs. 500" - NO, your time is worth more.</div>
    <h2>7. Homework - Get Your First Client This Week</h2>
    <p>1. Post on WhatsApp Status: "I Build Websites - Starting Rs. 8,000 - See My Work: [Your Portfolio Link] - WhatsApp Me"<br>2. Visit 5 local shops - Show portfolio on phone - Give your proposal<br>3. Message 10 people you know - "I build websites now, if anyone needs one, tell me"<br>4. Make Fiverr account AFTER you have 3 projects - Not before</p>
    <div class="box"><b>Remember:</b> Freelancing = You are your own boss | First client = Someone you know / Local shop, NOT Fiverr | Price = Beginner Landing Rs. 5,000-8,000, Shop Rs. 15,000-20,000 | Payment = 50% advance, 50% after delivery | Proposal = Personal + Problem + Solution + Proof + Price + Free demo | Never work free | Write everything on WhatsApp | Visit 10 shops = 1 client</div>
    <p><b>Next Step:</b> <a href="/lesson49">Lesson 49 - Interview Questions</a> - 30 most asked questions + answers. Get a job in a company too.</p>
